tasks.description:
Reads: workspace/scs001/publish-ledger.jsonl (all entries), workspace/scs001/manual-posts.jsonl (recorded count), workspace/scs001/viral-topics.json (hashtags). Computes: postsNeeded = 30 - recordedCount, daysLeft to Apr 7. If postsNeeded <= 0: exits silently (gate met). Finds first unposted entry where run_id→epoch file exists at workspace/scs001/run-{epoch}/caption/{video_id}-captioned.mp4. runIdToEpoch() helper same as /post-now. Formats message: '⏰ Posting time! Gate: {postsNeeded} posts needed, {daysLeft}d left

📹 {video_id}
📁 {shortPath}
🏷️ {hashtags}

→ /record {video_id} 0 after posting'. Sends via Telegram Bot API (https HTTPS request — same pattern as daily-digest.ts). env: CEO_TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN (or TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN), OWNER_TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID (or CEO_TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID).
